@startuml sequence-cancel-reservation
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Sequence — Cancel reservation (UC5)

actor "User\n(Customer or Admin)" as User
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as FE
participant "REST API\n(FastAPI)" as API
database "Database\n(SQLite)" as DB

User -> FE: Open "My reservations"\n(or "All reservations" as admin)
User -> FE: Click "Cancel" on a reservation
FE -> API: POST /reservations/{id}/cancel (JWT)
API -> DB: Load the reservation
DB --> API: reservation

alt not own reservation and user is not admin
  API --> FE: 403 Forbidden\n"Tato rezervace vám nepatří"
else reservation already CANCELLED
  API --> FE: 409 Conflict\n"Rezervace je již zrušena"
else CONFIRMED and the rental period already started
  API --> FE: 409 Conflict\n"Potvrzenou rezervaci nelze zrušit poté,\nco již začal termín výpůjčky"
else can be cancelled
  API -> DB: UPDATE status = CANCELLED
  DB --> API: reservation
  API --> FE: 200 OK {reservation}
  FE -> API: Reload the list\n(GET /reservations/me or GET /reservations/)
  API --> FE: 200 OK [reservations]
end

FE --> User: See result\n(cancelled, or error message)
@enduml
